[{"type": "subtitle", "time": 4320.229, "timestamp": "01:12:00", "text": "孩子们。我从不上传未经授权的内容"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 4322.79, "timestamp": "01:12:02", "text": "为了孩子们。”我这样做是为了不"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 4324.91, "timestamp": "01:12:04", "text": "需要一直这样做。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 4328.11, "timestamp": "01:12:08", "text": "因为我有时间"}, {"type": "chat", "time": 4334.878, "timestamp": "01:12:14", "author": "@Solar07910", "avatar": "https://yt4.ggpht.com/j5v2GtdHe5Mb397GDb3gC5IoevB6pG5og12wcUK7kXFCbhNgN7R_gyWKDv5Ctf9yda4r1JuD1w=s64-c-k-c0x00ffffff-no-rj", "message": "What is that red line?"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 4338.11, "timestamp": "01:12:18", "text": "我"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 4341.35, "timestamp": "01:12:21", "text": "意思是，即使是18岁以上，我们也不会做。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 4345.229, "timestamp": "01:12:25", "text": "18禁笑话或类似成人内容"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 4348.149, "timestamp": "01:12:28", "text": "这里有很多东西。我想保留它"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 4349.79, "timestamp": "01:12:29", "text": "健康"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 4353.43, "timestamp": "01:12:33", "text": "有可能，因为我严格遵守以下规则："}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 4355.83, "timestamp": "01:12:35", "text": "就是那种不骂脏话之类的。和"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 4358.55, "timestamp": "01:12:38", "text": "有时候我会因为……而把它发泄出来。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 4361.75, "timestamp": "01:12:41", "text": "压力和所有积压在心里的东西。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 4364.11, "timestamp": "01:12:44", "text": "但我其实喜欢"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 4368.149, "timestamp": "01:12:48", "text": "呃，某种不成文的规定就是不能这么说。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 4372.07, "timestamp": "01:12:52", "text": "即使嗯，因为频道已经开通了。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 4375.27, "timestamp": "01:12:55", "text": "我猜它已经被采用了，呃，当"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 4378.63, "timestamp": "01:12:58", "text": "合作者进来我不喜欢我"}]